traces/
preferences.jsonl
artifacts/

# The plan, the papers and the raw generated dataset stay local; the validated case set
# is committed at datasets/wajo_cases.jsonl. routes.md is part of the build, so the
# directory is ignored entry by entry rather than wholesale.
docs/*
!docs/routes.md
!docs/transcript1.md
!docs/analysis.md
